<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Telebras cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Telebras cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns has cut its rating for Brazilian telephone holding Telebras SA to attractive from buy, a source at the brokerage said Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- The company's American Depositary Receipts closed at 161-7/8 Monday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
